WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:10.520
AI applications may connect to tools, plugins, APIs, databases, email systems, ticketing systems, cloud services, or code repositories.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.820
These integrations can make AI systems useful, but they also increase risk.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:21.040
If a model is manipulated or confused, excessive tool permissions can turn a bad output into a real action.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:27.980
Integrations should use least privilege, approval workflows for sensitive actions, clear logging, and careful access boundaries.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:37.320
Teams should define which tools the system can use, what data it can access, which actions require human approval, and how tool activity is monitored.
